    {"id": "cake-smash", "s": "Wishing you a lovely birthday, and friends who actually let you eat the cake instead of smearing it all over your face.", "m": "Someone is definitely already planning the attack, so keep your eyes open after the candles.", "l": "Smearing aside, I hope your day is full of laughter, good food and people who make you feel truly celebrated. And keep a towel nearby, just in case."},
    {"id": "treat-demand", "s": "Another birthday, which means just one important question from all your friends: where’s the treat?", "m": "We’re flexible about the venue, but very serious about the biryani.", "l": "On a slightly more sincere note, I hope this year treats you even more generously than we expect you to treat us today."},
    {"id": "hbd-replies", "s": "May you have the energy to reply to every single “HBD” today without copy-pasting the same thank-you.", "m": "And the patience for relatives who wish you two days early, a day late and once more in the family group, just to be safe.", "l": "All those messages are noisy, but they’re proof of how many people are thinking of you. I hope the whole year feels as well-loved as your phone does right now."},
    {"id": "diet-tomorrow", "s": "On your birthday, calories don’t count, and neither does that second slice of cake.", "m": "The diet can start tomorrow, or next Monday, or whenever the leftover sweets run out.", "l": "Enjoy every bite today without a single guilty thought. And may the year ahead keep you healthy enough for many more celebrations like this one."},
    {"id": "secret-wish", "s": "May you make a really good birthday wish, even if it takes five full minutes while the candles slowly melt.", "m": "Everyone standing around with their phone cameras ready will happily wait. Probably.", "l": "Whatever you wish for, I hope the year ahead brings you good health, good people and a few lovely surprises you didn’t think to ask for."}
